    "text": "CONCLUDED\nLast Updated:\n5 hours ago\nRevisiting SpaceX Fundamentals\nWith the stock trading and early Wall Street estimates rolling in, it's possible to reexamine SpaceX fundamentals.\nIt's still expensive, with the valuation underpinned by huge expected sales growth tied to the AI boom.\nSpaceX shares were at $166 in midday trading on Friday, up nicely from their $135 IPO price. (Investors like a solid day-one pop.)",
